      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A la generation d'une app hebergee :\n  1. Token service account (workplace-provisioner)\n  2. Creer world (espace entreprise)\n  3. Creer 1 salon par bounded_context\n  4. Stocker world_id + salons dans apps.db\nSSO : OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE\nSalons non chiffres (widget leger) → dette E2EE",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A la generation d'une app hebergee :\n  1. Token service account (workplace-provisioner)\n  2. Creer world (espace entreprise)\n  3. Creer 1 salon par bounded_context\n  4. Stocker world_id + salons dans apps.db\nSSO : OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE\nSalons non chiffres (widget leger) → dette E2EE",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
